{"steam_appid":2390230,"steam_name":"The Chef's Shift","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2390230/556696/3680103b834dcbb752c08d2af9432d9fde267e82/1750813635/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1705488922","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256940466/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1705488922","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/8d23b9dd754ae8d287c0588641f169abe8acb86a/ss_8d23b9dd754ae8d287c0588641f169abe8acb86a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784026045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/f99f5a0c9ca9128162034f3a5a3864ef3cea2744/ss_f99f5a0c9ca9128162034f3a5a3864ef3cea2744.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784026045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/0fc6d349bc54002f3a31f7cedc15aefad86d10f6/ss_0fc6d349bc54002f3a31f7cedc15aefad86d10f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784026045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/e3bb6b6424c6ca1f065a7ee41673f746340f20a6/ss_e3bb6b6424c6ca1f065a7ee41673f746340f20a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784026045","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/121f4223b45694a8c288195d5e2fcdc6b79ec146/ss_121f4223b45694a8c288195d5e2fcdc6b79ec146.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784026045"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to cook up a storm in &quot;The Chef's Shift&quot; - a fast-paced typing game set in a bustling restaurant! With your keyboard as your weapon, you'll need to cook and serve delicious dishes to hungry customers before they lose their patience. But that's not all - you'll also need to juggle all kinds of crazy distractions, from rat invasions to unruly customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/52ce30c8dce8ffe36684511c9812e0ca.webp?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 teaspoon of <strong>chaotic, fast-paced</strong> gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 package of easy-to-pickup hard-to-master <strong>TYPING</strong> mechanic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 cup of fun <strong>time management</strong> bits </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/84a1f65267c22205a37a8f3605d02cc0.webp?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/0b2e767f6bb2c482ac98ffa24497a4b7.poster.avif?t=1784026045\" width=600 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/0b2e767f6bb2c482ac98ffa24497a4b7.webm?t=1784026045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/0b2e767f6bb2c482ac98ffa24497a4b7.mp4?t=1784026045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And we mean it! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Navigate through the menu by typing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Prepare &amp; serve your customers by typing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Select your dialogue choices by typing </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/98fbe310e55666eef6d5a5504dc9a400.webp?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/ac6ca3aac8cbb210f80699e58b07fc97.avif?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a culinary journey through 6 vibrant chapters, savoring the diverse flavors of cuisine all around the world, where each restaurant will represent different food culture, posing different quirks &amp; challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/c072c1e09531b84b02fc5fa45e6f2177.webp?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/6bccdac05f7fc0969020d5c53b720c94.avif?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game you will meet various characters, from customers with their own personality, to characters who propel the story forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390230/extras/38621430eb911316942d2e43e05e6ff1.webp?t=1784026045\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with at least 256MB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with at least 512MB of VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Panitia GameDev"],"publishers":["Catoptric Games"],"release_date":"31 Mar, 2025"}